2024-11-27 15:30:52,866  [processor_96_com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue] INFO  c.f.c.p.ProcessorTask#156 Get message {"clazz": "com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue", "key": "DEMO-4", "fields": {"summary": "Collecting custom request details", "description": "Define and organize incoming requests using *request types*. Capture and track relevant details upfront by customizing the *request types* you want to show up on the Help Center. You can also add *internal fields* to track details that you don't want your customers to see.\n\nh3. Try it out\n\nWe've given you some request types to try. Visit *Channels* (you may need to click *Back to project* to get out of your queues menu) to raise a request via your service project's Help Center and see them in action.", "priority": {"name": "High"}, "issuetype": {"name": "Service Request with Approvals"}, "creator": {"emailAddress": "himanshu@fwmstest.onmicrosoft.com"}}} from the kafka
