2024-11-27 16:28:46,349  [processor_99_com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue] INFO  c.f.c.p.ProcessorTask#156 Get message {"clazz": "com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue", "key": "DEMO-2", "fields": {"summary": "Capturing customer email requests", "description": "The easiest way for your customer's to request help is by sending an email request to your service project. When emails get sent to your project, they land in your queue as a request (just like this one).\n\nh3. Try it out\n\nEmail a request to *Demo service project's* support email address ( [mailto:demo@freshworks-ip.atlassian.net] ) to see how it looks for your customers and agents.", "priority": {"name": "Medium"}, "issuetype": {"name": "Service Request"}, "creator": {"emailAddress": "himanshu@fwmstest.onmicrosoft.com"}}} from the kafka
