2024-11-27 16:28:46,358  [processor_99_com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue] INFO  c.f.c.p.ProcessorTask#156 Get message {"clazz": "com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue", "key": "DEMO-9", "fields": {"summary": "Help! This is a high priority request", "description": "Track the priority of requests to spot problems quickly and set tighter *Service Level Agreement (SLA)* goals. Customers can set their own priority when raising a request, or you can hide it from customers and let your team decide.\nh3. Try it out\nAssign yourself and add a comment to stop the *Time to First Response* SLA from counting down. Resolve the request to stop all SLAs completely.", "priority": {"name": "Highest"}, "issuetype": {"name": "IT Help"}, "creator": {"emailAddress": "himanshu@fwmstest.onmicrosoft.com"}}} from the kafka
