2024-11-27 16:28:46,359  [processor_99_com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue] INFO  c.f.c.p.ProcessorTask#156 Get message {"clazz": "com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue", "key": "DEMO-8", "fields": {"summary": "Triaging requests into queues", "description": "Organise your customer's requests into queues to help your team stay focused while you keep track of what needs to be done. Build your own *queues* to split requests by agents, request types, office locations, status or your team's custom fields.\nh3. Try it out\nBuild a queue to show your recently resolved requests. Click *New queue* and update the status filter in *Issues to show* to only show requests set to *Resolved*.", "priority": {"name": "Medium"}, "issuetype": {"name": "IT Help"}, "creator": {"emailAddress": "himanshu@fwmstest.onmicrosoft.com"}}} from the kafka
