2024-11-27 16:28:46,370  [processor_99_com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue] INFO  c.f.c.p.ProcessorTask#156 Get message {"clazz": "com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue", "key": "DEMO-5", "fields": {"summary": "I need help connecting my laptop to the level 3 printer", "description": "I have been trying to print a document since 8am this morning but my laptop won't connect with the printer. I've restarted my laptop but it's still not working. If anyone has time to look soon, I'll be at my desk for most of the day.", "priority": {"name": "Highest"}, "issuetype": {"name": "Service Request"}, "creator": {"emailAddress": "himanshu@fwmstest.onmicrosoft.com"}}} from the kafka
