2024-11-27 16:28:47,878  [processor_99_com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue] INFO  c.f.c.p.ProcessorTask#156 Get message {"clazz": "com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue", "key": "DEMO-3", "fields": {"summary": "Agents & customers", "description": "*Agents* are the members of your team that answer and resolve requests from your *Customers*. In Jira Service Management, you only pay for agents and not the customers who raise requests. In other words, you can support as many customers as you need without paying any extra.\n\nReady to invite your team? Look for *Invite team* on your project's sidebar to the left (you may need to click *Back to project* to get out of your queues menu) to invite your team as agents.", "priority": {"name": "Highest"}, "issuetype": {"name": "IT Help"}, "creator": {"emailAddress": "himanshu@fwmstest.onmicrosoft.com"}}} from the kafka
