2024-11-27 16:28:47,898  [processor_99_com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue] INFO  c.f.c.p.ProcessorTask#156 Get message {"clazz": "com.freshworks.ip.external.demo.hagrid.beans.JiraIssue", "key": "DEMO-1", "fields": {"summary": "What is a request?", "description": "Requests are like emails from your customers asking for help. Like email, you can respond to the reporter and add attachments. Unlike email, you can set all kinds of useful information, such as labels, priority and a status showing where the request is up to.\n\nh3. Try it out\n\nWhen you've finished exploring this request, *update the status* to resolve it and let the reporter know it's done.", "priority": {"name": "Medium"}, "issuetype": {"name": "Service Request"}, "creator": {"emailAddress": "himanshu@fwmstest.onmicrosoft.com"}}} from the kafka
